components.description:
&lt;EuiColorPicker&gt;

Simple select field input with form row options.

Label and Input components have more options. Enter into each to change.

&lt;EuiCollapsibleNavGroup&gt;

The contents of a Collapsible Nav Group can be anything, but most commonly is a List Group.

Replace the List Group layer with a different component to change content type.

&lt;EuiDatePickerRange&gt;

Dual date/time range input with form row options.

Label and Input components have more options. Enter into each to change.

&lt;EuiDatePicker&gt;

Single date/time input with form row options.

Label and Input components have more options. Enter into each to change.

&lt;EuiExpression display=&quot;columns&quot;&gt;

Column expressions are great for lining up multiple expression blocks. The description components usually line up on the right, you can fake this by adding white space to shorter descriptions.

Expressions require both a value and description but they can optionally be clickable/editable.

&lt;EuiFilePicker&gt;

File picker input with form row options.

Label and Input components have more options. Enter into each to change.

&lt;EuiListGroup&gt;

Border and edge padding can be removed. 

Gutter sizes available are: 0, 8, 16

&lt;EuiProgress&gt;

The progress bar uses a text layer. Edit the invisible text to change the size of inner bar.

You can also swap any of the bar colors for a Viz or custom color. Just be sure to match that to the value text with the &quot;Text&quot; variant.
